<title>UK: BremerLB adds 500 mln Czech crown to one-year bond.</title>
<headline>BremerLB adds 500 mln Czech crown to one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier by joint lead managers Investmentbank Austria and WoodCommerz has been increased to 1.5 billion from 1.0 billion Czech crowns.</p>
<p>There is a new issue price of 100.82.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BREMER LANDESBANK CAPITAL MARKETS PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BREMER LANDESBANK KREDITANSTALT OLDENBURG-</p>
<p>		GIROZENTRALE</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN CZK   COUPON     11.125    MATURITY    22.JAN.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE *100.82    PAY DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 25	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.85</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINAL ISSUE PRICE OF 100.80.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
